            "review_title": "Review at Hủ Tiếu Thiên Phúc",
            "review_text": "Flora Thuy\n3 contributions\n0\nVietnam Specialty Foods\nOct 2024 • Family\nI don’t often write reviews, but I absolutely loved the Hu Tieu here. If you ever have the chance to visit Vietnam, make sure to try the Hu Tieu Sate at this spot – it’s a must-try! This dish is truly unique, with a rich, slightly spicy broth and tender, fresh beef that melts in your mouth. I also tried the refreshing Basil Seed Herbal Tea here, which was delicious and incredibly cooling\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 8, 2024",
