            "review_text": "Tuli Nguyen\n3 contributions\n0\nGreat place for good food in Saigon\nNov 2024 • Friends\nI decided to visit this spot after reading reviews on TripAdvisor. The restaurant is centrally located in District 1, close to Ben Thanh Market. The menu offers a delightful variety of authentic Vietnamese dishes, each one showcasing local flavors. The space itself is clean, airy, and spacious, creating a welcoming and relaxed atmosphere.\n\nThe food was absolutely delicious, with prices that felt very reasonable for the quality and portion sizes. The staff were friendly and attentive, adding to the overall positive experience. I look forward to the chance to visit again in the future!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 8, 2024",
